1
00:01:10,319 --> 00:01:10,760
Who's there?

2
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:21,680
Did you just

3
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:23,840
see a child?

4
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:26,760
No.

5
00:01:43,079 --> 00:01:43,719
I'm fine.

6
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:45,680
The thing is, did you guys

7
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:47,200
really not see that kid just now?

8
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:48,560
We really didn't.

9
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,319
You were just talking to yourself.

10
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:53,000
Who's there?

11
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:04,799
How long have you had this eye condition?

12
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,239
Ever since I barely

13
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:10,360
escaped the fire at the library pavilion,

14
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,199
I noticed my eyes

15
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,560
were different from normal people's.

16
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,199
Huai'er, run!

17
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,599
Run!

18
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,479
What's wrong with my master's eyes?

19
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,719
I'm not a doctor.

20
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,080
I can't tell much from this.

21
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,520
Maybe it's just from lack of sleep,

22
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:46,599
causing mild redness.

23
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:49,520
That wouldn't cause hallucinations, right?

24
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:54,039
He always sees those weird things.

25
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,240
Did heaven open his Third Eye?

26
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,360
Is he hallucinating?

27
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,319
Don't talk nonsense.

28
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,680
What hallucinations?

29
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:01,439
If you ask me,

30
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,360
he either has an eye problem,

31
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,400
or a brain problem.

32
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:06,840
But it's fine.

33
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:08,759
Once you solve the case,

34
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:11,319
I'll take you to the provincial hospital.

35
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:15,080
It's all over. It's all over.

36
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:16,599
Only four hours until dawn.

37
00:03:16,919 --> 00:03:18,199
And we haven't even pinned down a suspect.

38
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,120
What do we do?

39
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,400
That's right.

40
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:29,560
Don't worry.

41
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:30,599
As soon as the sun comes up,

42
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,199
Father will report to the chief,

43
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:34,840
and marry you off in grand style.

44
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:44,360
Mengzhu died from a Puppet Hidden Weapon,

45
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:46,159
and the First Madam died from tea

46
00:03:47,439 --> 00:03:49,840
laced with deadly oleander poison.

47
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,039
It seems the killer

48
00:03:52,759 --> 00:03:54,879
knows everyone in Li Mansion inside out.

49
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,039
And this puppet that keeps appearing,

50
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:01,759
I keep feeling

51
00:04:02,759 --> 00:04:03,759
that someone is intentionally

52
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:05,360
trying to tell us something.

53
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,280
Madam,

54
00:04:07,639 --> 00:04:09,120
the wedding ceremony is tomorrow morning.

55
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:10,879
There's no time to get new wedding shoes.

56
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,479
These were left by the Second Madam.

57
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,000
See if they fit you first.

58
00:04:14,879 --> 00:04:15,840
Just leave them there for now.

59
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,199
Um,

60
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:20,120
how did the Second Madam die?

61
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,000
The Second Madam...

62
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:24,680
she broke the Demon-Revealing Mirror,

63
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,120
and was haunted by an evil spirit.

64
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,839
A Demon-Revealing Mirror?

65
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,639
After the First Madam died,

66
00:04:31,279 --> 00:04:32,680
the Master, to drive off the Flower Demon,

67
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,720
hired a Spirit Medium to perform a ritual.

68
00:04:35,519 --> 00:04:36,360
Insolent Flower Demon!

69
00:04:36,959 --> 00:04:37,639
There's nowhere to hide!

70
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:40,680
Spirit Medium,

71
00:04:41,319 --> 00:04:43,560
Are you sure there's a Flower Demon here?

72
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:44,839
Absolutely certain.

73
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,040
Look at this compass spinning wildly.

74
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:49,079
The demonic aura in the mansion is heavy.

75
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,680
We must eliminate the demon immediately,

76
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,759
or the Flower Demon will cause havoc

77
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,120
and harm others.

78
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,759
Then hurry up and think of a way!

79
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:59,639
First, I'll perform an exorcism ritual,

80
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,920
then install a Demon-Revealing Mirror,

81
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:02,720
and set up a Warding array.

82
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,480
A Demon-Revealing Mirror?

83
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,279
Hang the Demon-Revealing Mirror up here,

84
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:10,399
and demons will reveal their true forms.

85
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,839
It also wards off evil and expels ghosts.

86
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:14,120
Remember,

87
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,560
you must never break this mirror.

88
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:18,759
Otherwise, if my Warding array is broken,

89
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:20,759
the Li Mansion will be in danger.

90
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:32,160
The Second Madam studied abroad.

91
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:34,360
Not only did she like her bedroom

92
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:35,759
decorated in a Western style,

93
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:38,279
she also didn't believe in superstitions.

94
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:40,480
Second Madam, you mustn't!

95
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:41,879
You absolutely mustn't, Second Madam!

96
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:43,920
I'm so sick of this superstitious junk!

97
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,199
Don't break it!

98
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:46,279
Second Madam!

99
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,240
She broke the Demon-Revealing Mirror,

100
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,480
and the Spirit Medium's Warding array.

101
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:52,879
Ever since then,

102
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,800
the disasters started.

103
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:08,879
It's the Flower Demon.

104
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:10,639
The Flower Demon is back!

105
00:06:11,959 --> 00:06:13,680
Didn't she just break a vase?

106
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,600
How is that related to the Flower Demon?

107
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,120
The broken vase...

108
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:18,920
...was just the beginning of the disaster.

109
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:22,680
After breaking the Demon-Revealing Mirror,

110
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,120
inside her room,

111
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,000
strange things kept happening.

112
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:28,160
Which of these two colors looks better?

113
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,959
They both look good on you.

114
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,360
In a couple of days,

115
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,480
I'll take you out to buy some new jewelry.

116
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:38,959
Master!

117
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,319
Are you okay?

118
00:06:40,439 --> 00:06:41,160
Let me help you up.

119
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:44,560
The furniture would break inexplicably,

120
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,399
and strange noises were heard at night.

121
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:56,920
What's wrong?

122
00:06:58,199 --> 00:06:58,920
It's getting late.

123
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,439
Let's go to sleep.

124
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,519
Since disasters kept happening in her room,

125
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:11,639
he hired a Spirit Medium for feng shui.

126
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:17,680
Lord Lao commands me to slay demons.

127
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,920
Granting me divine methods,

128
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,800
what demon dares not submit?

129
00:07:21,879 --> 00:07:23,360
What ghost dares to stand in my way?

130
00:07:23,879 --> 00:07:25,800
Bold demon!

131
00:07:26,079 --> 00:07:29,079
Show your true form at once!

132
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:30,680
Spirit Medium,

133
00:07:31,399 --> 00:07:33,000
what exactly is wrong with this room?

134
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:34,800
There's a wicked presence.

135
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:35,839
Master,

136
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:38,160
there's demonic energy in this room.

137
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,879
The demon is coming for the Second Madam.

138
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,360
Right at this moment,

139
00:07:42,639 --> 00:07:44,639
it is right above this crystal chandelier.

140
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,480
The crystal chandelier?

141
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:49,720
A thousand-year-old Flower Demon

142
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:52,680
fancies Madam's Western crystal chandelier.

143
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:55,079
To gather the Crystal's spiritual essence

144
00:07:55,519 --> 00:07:56,759
to cultivate its dark arts

145
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,560
and slaughter everyone!

146
00:07:59,639 --> 00:08:01,040
Slaughter everyone?!

147
00:08:02,439 --> 00:08:02,920
Somebody!

148
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:06,519
Take down this crystal chandelier now!

149
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:07,639
Stop!

150
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:08,160
Fine!

151
00:08:08,959 --> 00:08:10,639
Let's see who dares to touch my chandelier!

152
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,079
Madam!

153
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:11,839
I'll fight him!

154
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:12,560
Madam,

155
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,680
this chandelier has demonic energy!

156
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,120
This crystal chandelier of mine

157
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:18,480
was specially shipped back from France!

158
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,519
It's priceless!

159
00:08:20,639 --> 00:08:22,560
I doubt my chandelier has demonic energy,

160
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:25,199
it's you who has it, Spirit Medium!

161
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,959
Making up Flower Demons to scare people.

162
00:08:28,199 --> 00:08:29,319
I've absolutely had enough!

163
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:30,199
Alright, Madam.

164
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:31,199
Calm down, calm down.

165
00:08:31,279 --> 00:08:32,360
If you dare to take down my chandelier,

166
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:33,120
I'll beat you up too!

167
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:34,120
Okay, okay! We won't take it down!

168
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:35,320
As long as you like it,

169
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,519
you can have any chandelier you want.

170
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,080
It's one o'clock.

171
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:50,360
I was to meet the Master to try on suits.

172
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:51,919
Why isn't he back yet?

173
00:08:54,639 --> 00:08:55,120
Chunmei!

174
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:56,799
Chunmei!

175
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:58,840
Coming, coming!

176
00:08:59,679 --> 00:09:01,159
Go and see if the Master is back yet.

177
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,440
Yes, Madam.

178
00:09:09,879 --> 00:09:11,399
The Flower Demon killed someone!
